{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type Her to Sleep is a lo-fi typing game about spelling out thoughts to get a good night's sleep! Help Ada overcome her stress-induced sleep-deprivation by calming herself as she tries to prevent not a single stressful train of thought leave her mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type the stress away!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to a suggestion from a friend, Ada decided to spell out her thoughts while in bed to sleep faster. Otherwise, she'll be a restless mess on the next day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.poster.avif?t=1770460004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.webm?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.mp4?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It ain't easy being the boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every other day, Ada has to make decisions that will alter how her night will go. Some decisions make the night easier but makes the rest of the playthrough a lot easier... and vice versa!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.poster.avif?t=1770460004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.webm?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.mp4?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 2,000 words with lengths up to 12 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode where some nights will have you make decisions that alter the mode's difficulty!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714440?t=1770460004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/abc3a1555dde760a0e5fb6a8febf60d178be67f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770460004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770460004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770460004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4092800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type Her to Sleep is a lo-fi typing game about spelling out thoughts to get a good night's sleep! Help Ada overcome her stress-induced sleep-deprivation by calming herself as she tries to prevent not a single stressful train of thought leave her mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type the stress away!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to a suggestion from a friend, Ada decided to spell out her thoughts while in bed to sleep faster. Otherwise, she'll be a restless mess on the next day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.poster.avif?t=1770460004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.webm?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/6de9553ddb599797f76ca816deedda5e.mp4?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It ain't easy being the boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every other day, Ada has to make decisions that will alter how her night will go. Some decisions make the night easier but makes the rest of the playthrough a lot easier... and vice versa!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.poster.avif?t=1770460004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.webm?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/31239656deacc5fa7030dd10ff9f441f.mp4?t=1770460004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 2,000 words with lengths up to 12 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode where some nights will have you make decisions that alter the mode's difficulty!</p></li></ul>","developers":["SkilZent"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/2e7ae3830ec8a3b4711a212954b980032244b21b/header.jpg?t=1770460004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/898935397/8571d7c9f27bf086eef23b4427c7e0d0b1a98cdd/1769447657/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769448490","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/898935397/8571d7c9f27bf086eef23b4427c7e0d0b1a98cdd/1769447657/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769448490","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/898935397/8571d7c9f27bf086eef23b4427c7e0d0b1a98cdd/1769447657/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769448490","id":257273053,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257273053/eb881f81af6bf80a790781b642381cf1db0d05b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769448490"}],"name":"Type Her to Sleep","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selecti